{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261127/photo/bkn-20261127083032465-1127_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261127091416\"/><p>吐露港公路發生交通意外。</p><p>大埔發生交通意外。今晨(27日)8時13分，3輛私家車及1輛客貨車沿吐露港公路快線往九龍方向，至近元洲仔對開時，前方車輛懷疑因應路面交通情況收慢，尾隨車輛收掣不及撞上，造成4車「串燒」意外。意外中，3人受輕傷，清醒由救護車送院治理，意外原因有待調查。受事件影響，往九龍方向交通受阻。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T01:23:59.239929+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":162,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T00:30:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T01:17:33.007130+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T01:17:33.007130+00:00","content_hash":"52643e298f34a07cb1b29640a7b7bee6f4f2f99336d184bdd14b9cbdf71bb03f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}